WEBVTT

00:10.720 --> 00:14.090
Yo, Makie-chan. You're lively again today.

00:18.820 --> 00:22.160
But, your boobs are as small as always.

00:22.160 --> 00:24.490
Are you massaging them properly every day?

00:24.770 --> 00:27.540
Ew. Geez Toragorou-san.

00:30.050 --> 00:33.060
Yuuna-chan's are as massive as always!

00:34.970 --> 00:37.920
Don't the words sexual harassment exist in this world?!

00:40.700 --> 00:41.990
Yuuna! Yuuna!

00:42.310 --> 00:42.730
Eh?

00:43.050 --> 00:44.600
Look over there! Over there!

00:44.600 --> 00:50.590
Now we'll be interviewing Nagi-san who's made the brilliant achievement of winning thirteen straight battles since his debut.

00:51.270 --> 00:55.010
Hello, Nagi-san. We're broadcasting live across the world today!

00:55.370 --> 00:58.420
Makie-san, Yuuna-san, are you watching?

00:58.950 --> 01:00.410
It's me, Nagi.

01:00.980 --> 01:04.560
That teacher of yours is together with me!

01:05.180 --> 01:07.070
Eh... is that?!

01:07.070 --> 01:07.580
Yep.

01:08.050 --> 01:11.430
This place has all sorts of convenient transport access and the like so...

01:12.130 --> 01:16.520
Let's see... Let's meet at the opening of the Ostia Tournament in one month's time.

01:16.520 --> 01:18.800
Of course the two from the sports club will come too.

01:19.120 --> 01:21.680
Please don't worry about the way back to the Academy.

01:22.280 --> 01:24.550
I'm looking forward to seeing you at the tournament.

01:26.110 --> 01:28.310
H-He said we can get home?!

01:28.310 --> 01:31.350
Negi-kun, Ako and Akira are okay too!

01:32.950 --> 01:35.300
I wonder if everyone else is safe too?

01:36.240 --> 01:38.320
Anyway, we gotta earn the travel expenses!

01:38.460 --> 01:40.360
We're gonna work our butts off!

01:40.060 --> 01:40.950
That's great!

01:40.510 --> 01:42.680
Work to earn!

01:48.290 --> 01:52.490
Nagi-san, you have the same name and surname as that 'Thousand Master'...

01:52.490 --> 01:53.830
Perhaps you're blood relatives?

01:54.640 --> 01:56.090
I should say you're the spitting image of him.

01:56.440 --> 01:58.590
No. My resemblance to him is purely coincidental.

01:59.370 --> 02:01.870
I have no connection to him, but...

02:03.000 --> 02:06.970
I'm not going to bring shame to this strong man's name.

02:09.410 --> 02:11.020
I'm awaiting formidable opponents!

02:11.020 --> 02:12.730
Please come and do your worst!

02:15.110 --> 02:19.990
That was the rookie victor you were watching, Nagi Springfield.

04:06.350 --> 04:11.430
I wonder if Makie-san and the others received that message earlier...

04:11.430 --> 04:16.600
Thanks to the value of your father's name, there's bound to be a lot of media exposure.

04:19.160 --> 04:23.030
After that, all there is to do is to have faith in everyone and pray for good fortune.

04:23.620 --> 04:26.430
Then let's review the situation a little.

04:27.330 --> 04:28.030
Asakura.

04:28.210 --> 04:31.200
Right. Putting together the information gathered so far...

04:31.480 --> 04:35.710
It does indeed look like all the gateports were destroyed in this incident.

04:36.910 --> 04:39.430
It's the worst possible situation...

04:39.430 --> 04:40.260
However!

04:40.260 --> 04:40.710
Yep.

04:41.960 --> 04:43.030
The abandoned city of Ostia.

04:43.580 --> 04:50.340
In this city that became ruins in the war 20 years ago, there's a gateport not in use now.

04:50.340 --> 04:56.040
Hmm... In other words, we've gotta get to that place in the capital for us to get home.

04:56.040 --> 05:00.560
Yes. Even with incredibly good fortune on our side, in one month...

05:01.400 --> 05:05.250
The national prize-fighting tournament will be held in that city.

05:05.250 --> 05:06.310
What's important about that is...

05:06.310 --> 05:10.810
Right! The prize money from that national tournament is one million drachma!

05:11.290 --> 05:12.330
If we get that prize money,

05:13.080 --> 05:15.330
we'll be able to take back Ako-san and the others from slavehood.

05:17.430 --> 05:18.170
In other words...

05:18.560 --> 05:22.120
We might be able to settle all of our problems at this festival...

05:22.450 --> 05:23.670
is what you're saying, right?

05:23.670 --> 05:26.250
Settle everything...?

05:26.250 --> 05:29.170
Alright! The tide seems to have turned our way!

05:29.480 --> 05:36.100
But to do that, Negi-kun and Kotaro-kun have to be victorious enough to qualify to enter the tournament...

05:36.470 --> 05:37.230
Are you confident?

05:37.470 --> 05:38.480
Leave it to us.

05:38.850 --> 05:39.810
We'll be fine.

05:40.140 --> 05:43.440
At this point, there's no reason to even discuss failure.

05:50.340 --> 05:53.480
<i>Having said that, there is one factor that worries me.</i>

05:54.340 --> 05:55.950
<i>Fate Averruncus...</i>

05:59.260 --> 06:01.040
<i>I can't beat him the way I am now.</i>

06:01.520 --> 06:05.030
<i>This plan is futile if I don't get the power to beat him.</i>

06:05.510 --> 06:07.670
<i>But, how do I beat him?</i>

06:08.190 --> 06:10.050
<i>Something is lacking.</i>

06:10.050 --> 06:11.100
<i>Something...</i>

06:13.290 --> 06:14.650
"Idiocy"?

06:14.650 --> 06:17.970
Yeah, indeed I did tell you that you were lacking it.

06:18.250 --> 06:19.480
Yep. Is that...?

06:19.480 --> 06:22.940
Look, that scary master would have told you.

06:24.640 --> 06:29.070
Asuna-neechan is more like the Thousand Master than you.

06:29.440 --> 06:30.780
Y-Yeah...

06:31.200 --> 06:34.910
The common feature of those two is basically idiocy.

06:35.100 --> 06:36.870
Eeh?! Really?

06:36.870 --> 06:39.780
That's just a guess of mine. The thought came to me.

06:40.060 --> 06:42.580
Just Asuna-neechan has it.

06:42.580 --> 06:48.130
Indeed, that may be the "important thing one needs to get stronger" that she has that you don't.

06:48.810 --> 06:50.840
<i>Hmm. I see.</i>

06:51.270 --> 06:53.340
<i>Asuna-san is like that.</i>

06:54.470 --> 06:58.360
<i>But it'd be impossible for me to suddenly become like Asuna-san.</i>

06:59.470 --> 07:01.100
<i>What I'm lacking...</i>

07:02.600 --> 07:06.150
<i>There is of course... something like my own special attack.</i>

07:06.490 --> 07:08.280
What's this about a special attack?

07:11.220 --> 07:15.690
It's only natural that a guy would have one or two special attacks.

07:16.060 --> 07:17.490
W-Who are you?

07:17.950 --> 07:21.500
I'd worry about what's over your head right now, Mr. Celebrity.

07:33.480 --> 07:34.220
Who's there!?

07:38.840 --> 07:43.230
I'm here in response to your call, Nagi Springfield.

07:44.060 --> 07:46.270
I'm Kagetarou of Bosporus.

07:47.080 --> 07:49.650
I challenge you to an ordinary duel.

07:49.850 --> 07:52.740
Hold on, please. You'll cause damage to the city here...!

08:00.930 --> 08:02.110
<i>That was dangerous.</i>

08:02.110 --> 08:04.780
<i>Just now, he targeted my vital organs without hesitation...</i>

08:06.750 --> 08:08.870
Ras Tel Ma Scir Magister

08:08.870 --> 08:11.110
Evocation of the Valkyries

08:08.870 --> 08:11.110
Evocatio Valcyriarum

08:16.320 --> 08:18.070
<i>That's a tremendous ability.</i>

08:18.070 --> 08:20.140
<i>No, more importantly, this guy...</i>

08:22.850 --> 08:23.940
<i>is seriously out to get me.</i>

08:24.940 --> 08:25.720
Decoy!

08:29.840 --> 08:31.940
<i>A duel with my life at stake.</i>

08:33.350 --> 08:35.320
<i>A real battle to the death.</i>

08:35.870 --> 08:39.010
It's been a while since a human has survived three attacks.

08:39.010 --> 08:40.830
Good. If not...

08:43.760 --> 08:46.020
<i>I can't find an opening to counter-attack.</i>

08:46.020 --> 08:48.240
<i>It's just like fighting Master.</i>

08:48.650 --> 08:52.420
<i>No, if it wasn't for Master's training, it'd be over in an instant.</i>

08:52.970 --> 08:53.840
<i>This guy's...</i>

08:55.440 --> 08:56.300
<i>the real thing!</i>

08:57.980 --> 08:59.550
<i>Through five layers of magic barrier!</i>

09:00.170 --> 09:05.290
<i>A powerful barrier penetrating phantasmagorical high speed physical attack...</i>

09:06.100 --> 09:06.810
<i>He's strong!</i>

09:14.140 --> 09:16.720
<i>A real.... formidable opponent...</i>

09:20.660 --> 09:22.490
Extraordinarily amazing magic power...!

09:39.890 --> 09:41.350
One Hundred Shadow Lances

09:39.890 --> 09:41.350
Centum Lanceae Umbrae

09:42.310 --> 09:42.980
Unleash

09:42.310 --> 09:42.980
Emittam

09:43.180 --> 09:46.060
Incomplete Sword of Conviction

09:43.180 --> 09:46.060
Imperfactus Ensis Exsequens

09:48.310 --> 09:49.350
Unleash

09:48.310 --> 09:49.350
Emittam

09:51.610 --> 09:52.730
Got you!

09:59.070 --> 10:00.160
What a shame.

10:03.520 --> 10:04.830
It's my victory.

10:05.950 --> 10:06.870
I've still...

10:06.870 --> 10:08.250
Still got my left hand!

10:08.670 --> 10:09.500
Unleash

10:08.670 --> 10:09.500
Emittam

10:10.430 --> 10:12.040
A triple delay spell?!

10:19.880 --> 10:22.700
Hehe, that was quite the show,

10:23.160 --> 10:25.770
but let me take care of this duel.

10:25.980 --> 10:26.430
Wha...?!

10:26.930 --> 10:27.680
Damn you...!

10:28.450 --> 10:29.690
You're from "Ala Rubra"?!

10:30.850 --> 10:32.690
Rakan of the Thousand Swords!

10:35.350 --> 10:37.940
That's one of my father's companions?

10:38.210 --> 10:39.130
No way.

10:39.130 --> 10:44.240
Besides Eishun and Takamichi, the whereabouts of the other Ala Rubra members should be unknown!

10:44.700 --> 10:45.990
Ala Rubra?

10:45.990 --> 10:48.600
What's that? Never heard of it.

10:49.470 --> 10:53.170
So what if I was from that Ala something or other?

10:53.490 --> 10:59.760
Hmph. In that case, I wouldn't need to fight this nobody youngster.

11:00.630 --> 11:02.300
I don't even want to!

11:08.270 --> 11:09.650
Come!

11:08.270 --> 11:09.650
Adeat!

11:10.920 --> 11:11.850
An artifact...

11:17.370 --> 11:18.490
Absurd.

11:18.490 --> 11:21.350
That can freely transform into any weapon.

11:21.350 --> 11:23.740
It's an infamous unparalleled item.

11:23.740 --> 11:27.040
That's right. I'm going to give you a special viewing for free today.

11:27.460 --> 11:31.200
This is the artifact...

11:31.200 --> 11:34.960
The Hero with a Thousand Faces

11:31.200 --> 11:34.960
Ο ήρωας με τα χίλιον πρόσωπον

11:41.170 --> 11:41.880
Final move:

11:42.930 --> 11:44.450
Warship Breaker!

11:42.930 --> 11:44.450
Zan Kan Ken!

11:49.680 --> 11:50.480
Amazing!

11:55.940 --> 11:57.980
You want power, kid?

11:58.570 --> 12:00.880
When you're healed of those wounds, come see me.

12:01.870 --> 12:04.740
You might be able to obtain what you desire.

12:05.120 --> 12:05.750
Power...

12:16.320 --> 12:17.540
It seems okay.

12:26.590 --> 12:28.010
Chisama-sa-

12:28.510 --> 12:30.270
Umm, my wound...

12:31.980 --> 12:34.390
Target lock on.

12:34.970 --> 12:35.650
Fire!

12:37.090 --> 12:38.700
U-Umm...

12:38.700 --> 12:41.780
If Kagurazaka were here, she'd hit you...

12:41.780 --> 12:42.490
I'm doing it for her.

12:43.490 --> 12:45.360
Geez, talk about unreasonable.

12:45.700 --> 12:47.850
You deserve it even if you are all healed now.

12:48.470 --> 12:52.250
I'm sorry, Chisame-san, Chachamaru-san...

12:52.580 --> 12:54.700
for making you worry about me.

12:54.700 --> 12:57.440
Hmph. Who said we were worried?

12:57.440 --> 13:02.170
In your case, you could say you're better off having your stomach cut open once in a while.

13:02.170 --> 13:03.010
Got it?

13:04.140 --> 13:06.490
Hey, I've got news. News!

13:06.490 --> 13:07.800
It's big news!

13:08.180 --> 13:11.080
We've gotten word from our companions!

13:11.080 --> 13:12.100
Eh? Really?!

13:12.470 --> 13:15.310
It must be the result of that live broadcast four days ago.

13:15.310 --> 13:15.850
Who's it from?!

13:16.630 --> 13:19.030
Probably... Setsuna-neechan's group!!

13:31.490 --> 13:32.160
Alright.

13:33.130 --> 13:35.130
Ah...this feels so good.

13:35.990 --> 13:38.180
Ah! A bath would be great.

13:38.180 --> 13:39.460
I might just join you.

13:44.920 --> 13:46.720
Why are you getting undressed!?

13:47.040 --> 13:49.370
I can't bathe unless I get undressed now, can I?

13:49.370 --> 13:51.310
Have you groomed your feathers yet?

13:51.310 --> 13:52.720
I'll give you a hand.

14:10.450 --> 14:12.700
Um... there really is something weird about this.

14:14.110 --> 14:14.950
How so?

14:15.340 --> 14:17.990
I often wash your back at the dorm, don't I?

14:17.990 --> 14:22.380
Well, that and my feathers aren't quite the same... you know.

14:22.680 --> 14:24.040
Why?

14:24.040 --> 14:27.590
But I love fiddling with your wings.

14:27.910 --> 14:32.620
S-So, you're really cheery today, Asuna-san.

14:32.620 --> 14:36.480
That must be because you heard from the TV broadcast that Negi-sensei's fine.

14:36.480 --> 14:36.970
Eh!?

14:36.970 --> 14:38.720
N-No, you're wrong.

14:38.720 --> 14:41.720
It's not just him, it's because everyone else is safe too.

14:42.110 --> 14:46.470
You were so incredibly depressed when I met up with you, Asuna-san.

14:46.990 --> 14:50.020
L-Like you can talk.

14:50.020 --> 14:53.930
You were all flustered like it was the end of the world about Konoka.

14:55.270 --> 14:57.450
Konoka... Ojou-sama...

14:57.710 --> 14:58.330
Uh.

14:58.710 --> 15:00.290
Ojou-sama!

15:01.060 --> 15:03.290
What's happening to you right now?!

15:03.870 --> 15:05.340
Kono-chan!

15:06.090 --> 15:08.080
Knowing Konoka, she'll be fine.

15:08.420 --> 15:12.270
With her outlook, she's always much more level-headed than us,

15:12.270 --> 15:14.100
since she has real life experience.

15:17.910 --> 15:19.600
No more grumbling.

15:20.030 --> 15:22.010
We just have to do what we have to do.

15:25.660 --> 15:26.440
R-Right.

15:26.930 --> 15:29.070
I'm sure everyone else is fine too.

15:29.860 --> 15:30.820
Asuna-san.

15:31.240 --> 15:34.470
We'll meet up with everyone safely in a month,

15:35.070 --> 15:40.200
and Chao Bao Zi will wrap it up with, "What an incredible summer vacation it was!"

15:50.310 --> 15:52.320
This is the search route?

15:52.320 --> 15:54.330
It's really an "around the world" trip.

15:54.330 --> 15:57.470
It will cover the majority of the densely populated areas.

15:57.470 --> 16:00.020
We should be able to find all of our members like this.

16:00.020 --> 16:03.740
But, that's just confirming locations from the sky,

16:03.740 --> 16:05.350
so isn't that pointless, Asakura?

16:05.630 --> 16:10.110
Hehehe, this is where I bring out the real trump card in our strategy.

16:12.400 --> 16:13.920
This!

16:16.280 --> 16:17.780
A pactio card!?

16:19.920 --> 16:24.090
I, Asakura Kazumi, have the artifact "Oculus Corvunis"!

16:24.090 --> 16:26.630
As per it's name, it's a spy item!

16:26.630 --> 16:31.620
It's able to control up to six spy golems at ultra long distance by remote control!

16:31.900 --> 16:38.130
Having found our companions, I can clearly tell what their condition is by pointing it at them.

16:38.130 --> 16:42.050
That's great, but when did you score a pactio?!

16:42.050 --> 16:43.140
I didn't hear about it.

16:43.410 --> 16:46.090
Where exactly do you think we are?

16:46.090 --> 16:48.150
There are pactio stores here.

16:48.610 --> 16:51.140
And with that, here's my...

16:51.680 --> 16:54.140
first kiss commemoration photo.

16:55.270 --> 16:57.660
No way is that your first kiss.

16:58.460 --> 17:00.170
I wonder about that.

17:01.600 --> 17:05.670
Negi-kun was blushing and trembling so innocently.

17:05.670 --> 17:06.910
Asakura-san.

17:08.080 --> 17:10.720
Don't go putting on that little girl face, bitch.

17:21.750 --> 17:22.850
They're gone.

17:23.200 --> 17:27.810
I hope they can confirm the whereabouts of everyone even one day earlier.

17:28.730 --> 17:32.070
Chisame-neechan, you're not going because of the travel expenses?

17:32.070 --> 17:33.110
There is that,

17:33.650 --> 17:36.930
but I'm going to stay here and collect information.

17:37.440 --> 17:40.240
Akashi and Makie can't be detected by radar,

17:40.700 --> 17:41.490
and besides...

17:45.380 --> 17:48.250
Um... Chisame-san, Kotarou-kun...

17:48.870 --> 17:49.400
Yeah.

17:49.810 --> 17:50.750
We know.

17:51.260 --> 17:55.420
You want to go train under that old guy, don't you?

17:56.550 --> 17:58.670
That's fine with me. Go.

17:59.110 --> 18:00.720
Let me take care of the performances.

18:01.670 --> 18:05.410
Kotarou-kun...I'm sorry.

18:05.410 --> 18:07.720
Umm... Sorry I...

18:09.750 --> 18:14.020
Once a guy's made up his mind, he doesn't keep up with the pointless chatter, you blockhead!

18:14.020 --> 18:18.110
B-But I won't be directly involved with rescuing everyone.

18:18.110 --> 18:18.860
Idiot!

18:19.610 --> 18:22.370
If you want to do something, go ahead and do it.

18:22.370 --> 18:25.380
That old man, he's one of your father's companions, right?

18:25.380 --> 18:29.320
Either way, go out there and get that ultimate power.

18:32.120 --> 18:33.340
Kotarou-kun.

18:42.020 --> 18:43.240
I'll do my best!

18:43.240 --> 18:44.100
Same here!

18:44.760 --> 18:48.110
<i>Besides, someone has to watch over him.</i>

18:48.410 --> 18:51.320
<i>I'll have to go in Kagurazaka's place.</i>

19:05.470 --> 19:07.250
Ah, over there!

19:10.640 --> 19:11.760
Is that an oasis?

19:19.520 --> 19:21.370
They're some kind of ruins.

19:24.220 --> 19:25.680
Rakan-san...!

19:26.180 --> 19:27.710
Rakan-san...!

19:28.870 --> 19:30.580
Rakan-san...!

19:31.330 --> 19:33.020
Oh, that's him, isn't it?

19:33.870 --> 19:34.520
Ah.

19:41.600 --> 19:43.450
I wonder what he's doing?

19:43.450 --> 19:44.490
Training?

19:49.950 --> 19:51.210
Supreme ruler {is this for TS?}

19:49.950 --> 19:51.210
Haou

19:53.080 --> 19:54.050
Burning

19:53.080 --> 19:54.050
En

19:54.410 --> 19:55.790
Heat

19:54.410 --> 19:55.790
Netsu

19:55.790 --> 19:57.140
Thundering Dragon

19:55.790 --> 19:57.140
Gouryuu

19:57.140 --> 19:58.320
Roar

19:57.140 --> 19:58.320
Houkou

19:58.760 --> 20:03.090
Erupting Flash Demon Tempest, Rakan Fist!

19:58.760 --> 20:03.090
Bakuretsu Senkoku Majin Zankuuu Rakan Ken!

20:10.660 --> 20:12.480
Guh, no good.

20:12.690 --> 20:14.950
The activation name's too long.

20:14.950 --> 20:16.310
It doesn't sound any good either...

20:16.600 --> 20:20.890
Tsk... I'm thinking too hard. It needs boiling down.

20:20.890 --> 20:23.870
It needs to be much simpler,

20:23.870 --> 20:25.600
returning to the basics with his name in it...

20:25.600 --> 20:27.830
Yeeah... Negi-fist!

20:32.310 --> 20:33.850
Negi-fist?

20:34.090 --> 20:36.470
Guh, no good.

20:36.470 --> 20:38.430
It doesn't sound good,

20:38.430 --> 20:40.440
and there's not enough time to strike a pose.

20:40.840 --> 20:42.350
No good, no good.

20:42.350 --> 20:43.690
This name isn't working at all,

20:43.690 --> 20:46.850
it's got my name written all over it as a final move!

20:47.240 --> 20:50.200
Shit, it's the deadline!

20:50.200 --> 20:51.260
What do I do?

20:51.460 --> 20:52.850
What do I do?!

20:53.330 --> 20:55.100
But I am really fired up.

20:55.900 --> 20:56.730
Hang on...

20:57.310 --> 21:00.510
Perhaps I was wrong to put too much emphasis on the kanji?

21:01.580 --> 21:05.070
A simple straight right fist is boring.

21:05.070 --> 21:06.680
It needs to be more original.

21:06.680 --> 21:08.610
Oh, how about this...?

21:08.610 --> 21:10.350
Something coming out of the eyes...

21:10.350 --> 21:13.090
Hmm... Or from the whole body...

21:13.370 --> 21:15.120
Something coming from the whole body...

21:15.120 --> 21:16.120
That's it!

21:16.120 --> 21:21.960
Eternal Negi Fever!

21:32.500 --> 21:34.810
Oh. Oooh.

21:34.810 --> 21:37.700
I tried to get the right sort of beam of light coming from the whole body,

21:37.700 --> 21:41.340
but this magnitude of power...

21:41.940 --> 21:42.860
It's perfect!

21:43.350 --> 21:44.550
That guy's son.

21:44.550 --> 21:46.990
Negi's new final move!

21:46.990 --> 21:49.050
<i>Eh?! Mine?!</i>

21:49.050 --> 21:49.990
<i>Impossible.</i>

21:49.990 --> 21:51.730
<i>This guy's no use.</i>

21:52.320 --> 21:56.250
Your old man's companions are nothing but perverts.

21:56.640 --> 21:58.690
Forget this guy, Sensei.

21:57.260 --> 21:59.300
Eternal Negi...

21:58.690 --> 22:01.740
Just get some info about your father and let's go...

22:02.590 --> 22:03.300
Sensei?

22:04.690 --> 22:06.670
<i>But he's an idiotic person!</i>

22:07.070 --> 22:07.680
Huh?!

22:08.920 --> 22:11.070
If I'm to study under anyone now,

22:11.070 --> 22:13.230
it can only be this person!

22:13.230 --> 22:14.770
W-Wait, you idiot.

22:14.770 --> 22:15.680
Don't be hasty!

22:20.600 --> 22:21.690
Rakan-san!

22:22.720 --> 22:24.910
Oh, you came, kid!

22:24.910 --> 22:26.740
You came at just the right time.

22:27.310 --> 22:30.200
I've just perfected a final move for you!

22:31.310 --> 22:33.200
N-No, aside from that...

22:34.380 --> 22:38.070
Please... teach me how to fight!

22:38.070 --> 22:40.950
I don't have much time, but... I want to be stronger!

22:41.880 --> 22:42.330
Hmm...

22:43.770 --> 22:44.690
That's great.

22:45.610 --> 22:48.090
But... my training might be tough.

22:48.430 --> 22:49.700
I don't care.

22:49.700 --> 22:51.590
I'll withstand whatever training it takes!

22:58.400 --> 22:59.760
Alright.

23:00.080 --> 23:02.920
Before we start your training, show me your strength.

23:03.450 --> 23:05.790
Hit me in the stomach with all your might.

23:05.790 --> 23:06.310
O-Okay.

23:06.810 --> 23:07.690
But...

23:09.090 --> 23:10.200
Just hit me!

23:10.490 --> 23:13.200
If your punch sucks, there'll be no training.

23:14.140 --> 23:14.650
A-Alright.

23:15.000 --> 23:16.950
Battle Song

23:15.000 --> 23:16.950
Cantus Bellax

23:17.560 --> 23:19.210
Maximum Output!

23:17.560 --> 23:19.210
Vis Maxima!

23:20.210 --> 23:20.750
Wrong!

23:22.190 --> 23:25.170
You must have a much stronger attack.

23:25.170 --> 23:27.250
Hit me with the maximum output of that.

23:28.080 --> 23:29.260
B-But...

23:29.830 --> 23:30.940
Just do it, kid.

23:31.500 --> 23:35.000
Well, I won't say I'm more powerful than your old man,

23:35.490 --> 23:38.330
but it's true that I'm at the same level as him.

23:38.700 --> 23:39.500
Well?

23:40.310 --> 23:42.810
The old man you admire,

23:42.810 --> 23:45.860
do you think he'd be done in by a half-assed technique...

23:46.290 --> 23:51.530
that someone wet behind the ears like you just dreamed up?

23:54.200 --> 23:57.200
That's what it means to be the most powerful of magic users.

23:57.850 --> 23:58.920
How about it, kid?

23:59.420 --> 24:00.690
Try me.

24:05.740 --> 24:08.660
Ras Tel Ma Scir Magister

24:08.660 --> 24:11.890
O' 101 Spirits of Light

24:08.660 --> 24:11.890
Centium Eto Unos Spiritus Lucis

24:12.300 --> 24:14.950
Come together and strike mine enemy!

24:12.300 --> 24:14.950
Coeuntēs Inimīcum Sagittent

24:14.950 --> 24:16.760
Sagitta Magica

24:16.760 --> 24:20.610
101 Arrows of Light!

24:16.760 --> 24:20.610
Convergentia Lucum

24:22.500 --> 24:24.940
<i>Oh, nicely woven in arrows.</i>

24:26.700 --> 24:30.620
<i>This is the maximum number of magic arrows I can gather in my fist.</i>

24:34.070 --> 24:38.870
<i>Father, this is all the power I have right now!</i>

24:40.830 --> 24:42.370
Blossom Crushing Fist!

24:40.830 --> 24:42.370
Ouka Houken!

24:55.570 --> 24:57.510
Ra-Rakan-san...

25:04.020 --> 25:06.650
U-Unharmed! Amazing...

25:12.150 --> 25:13.650
Rakan-san?!

25:14.450 --> 25:16.320
That hurt, dammit!

25:26.710 --> 25:27.450
Ah, crap.

25:27.880 --> 25:29.340
Are you okay, kid?

25:30.560 --> 25:31.710
Is he okay?

25:32.060 --> 25:34.040
Him as your teacher...?

25:42.240 --> 25:43.060
What?!

25:43.790 --> 25:46.020
<i>That</i>  Evangeline's your master!?

25:46.560 --> 25:48.170
Y-Yes.

25:51.820 --> 25:53.150
What a piece of work!

25:54.050 --> 25:54.930
Her, eh?

25:55.630 --> 25:59.160
No wonder I thought you were strangely disciplined.

26:00.060 --> 26:00.660
Strangely?

26:01.000 --> 26:03.190
I get the picture.

26:03.190 --> 26:04.720
You pass.

26:04.720 --> 26:05.530
Alright.

26:05.830 --> 26:10.290
Right... so, why do you want to get stronger, kid?

26:13.390 --> 26:16.670
There must be some opponent you wanna beat, right?

26:20.090 --> 26:21.430
Well...

26:21.730 --> 26:22.640
Bullseye, huh?

26:23.250 --> 26:24.380
That's fine.

26:24.380 --> 26:26.880
Guys with clear objectives like that are better off.

26:26.880 --> 26:28.170
So, who is it?

26:29.780 --> 26:33.240
The mysterious boy called Fate Averruncus.

26:33.890 --> 26:35.400
He destroyed the gateports.

26:36.480 --> 26:37.400
Averruncus...

26:42.270 --> 26:44.910
That name brings back memories...

26:45.110 --> 26:47.410
I see, so that's how it is...

26:47.710 --> 26:49.080
Do you know him?

26:49.950 --> 26:51.080
You could say that.

26:51.320 --> 26:56.340
Well, if your opponent is close to what I imagine him to be... he's trouble.

26:56.870 --> 26:58.820
Now, I'll make a table.

26:59.480 --> 27:00.090
Table?

27:01.180 --> 27:03.680
Yeah, a strength table.

27:04.980 --> 27:08.970
We'll put Miss Chisame, who can't even use magic, here.

27:09.870 --> 27:12.190
Weapons currently in use in the old world are here.

27:12.190 --> 27:14.460
The kid is about here.

27:14.460 --> 27:16.690
Then, Kagetarou is about here.

27:16.690 --> 27:18.690
Takamichi's about here.

27:18.690 --> 27:22.120
He's never really serious though...

27:23.630 --> 27:24.700
This is about right.

27:25.270 --> 27:27.600
What a stupid table.

27:27.600 --> 27:30.520
You mean, teacher's more powerful than a tank!?

27:31.120 --> 27:32.970
What's the basis for these numbers?

27:32.970 --> 27:34.400
An Aegis battleship..

27:34.400 --> 27:36.460
Well, it's nothing more than a rough estimate.

27:36.940 --> 27:39.170
Think of it as an approximate guide to the differences in physical strength.

27:39.900 --> 27:41.680
It is compatible with showdowns.

27:41.910 --> 27:46.960
Even with luck on your side, if there's a large discrepancy in strength, that's the reason the chance of victory is slim.

27:47.540 --> 27:48.850
Your opponent,

27:48.850 --> 27:51.480
the mysterious boy's strength...

27:51.480 --> 27:52.180
is about here.

27:59.470 --> 28:00.760
That's...

28:03.730 --> 28:04.780
No way.

28:05.190 --> 28:06.970
With that much discrepancy,

28:06.970 --> 28:08.280
it doesn't matter how much I train.

28:08.910 --> 28:11.810
It's flat out impossible doing it fair and square.

28:16.570 --> 28:18.090
Don't jump to conclusions.

28:18.580 --> 28:20.030
It may be impossible doing it fair and square,

28:20.590 --> 28:22.520
but it doesn't mean there isn't a way that isn't fair and square.

28:23.750 --> 28:24.840
R-Really?!

28:25.430 --> 28:26.210
Yeah.

28:27.050 --> 28:28.680
Dark Magic.

28:27.050 --> 28:28.680
Magia Erebea
